abstract: "A dataset of 10,000 synthetic triangles and standalone NumPy construction code. Two side lengths and their included angle are sampled independently; the remaining side and angles are derived from triangle geometry. No model training, evaluation results, data partitions, or TBM engineering data are included."
keywords:
  - synthetic geometry
  - triangle dataset
  - dataset construction
  - mutual feedback neural network
